 "session_ne": "दोस्रो",
 "summary": "The name of this bill is \"Some Nepal Acts Provision Revival Bill, 2083\" and the title of the Act shall be \"Some Nepal Acts Provision Revival Act, 2083\" (Section 1, Subsection 1, Page 5). Its main purpose is to restore the previous provisions as they were prior to the issuance of the ordinance from the date the ordinance became inactive, as the Special Provisions Relating to Vacation of Office of Public Officials Ordinance, 2083 issued on 2083/01/19 became inactive pursuant to Article 114 of the Constitution of Nepal (Objectives and Reasons, Page 1). The provisions of eighty-five Acts, including the Nepal Airlines Corporation Act, 2019, which were amended pursuant to Section 3 and repealed pursuant to Section 4 of the Special Provisions Relating to Vacation of Office of Public Officials Ordinance, 2083, shall be deemed to have automatically revived as they were prior to such amendment or repeal (Section 2, Page 5). It is stated that this bill will not impose an additional financial burden (Financial Note, Page 2). This Act shall come into force immediately (Section 1, Subsection 2, Page 5).",
 "title": "Some Nepal Acts Provision Revival Bill, 2083",
